    {
      "id": "p79104EyhuDGlhf5ftIGd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4366.001248285315,
      "y": 4222.307040419391,
      "width": 753.8072509765625,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 941643115,
      "version": 56,
      "versionNonce": 1150508573,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789577882910,
      "created": 1789496543790,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Final Considerations\nEdge Cases to Solve\nCold Start / Idle Keys:\n\nIf a brand-new API key starts making requests, how does a region\nknow how many tokens to give it without contacting the control plane?\n\nSolution: Pre-allocate a default low \"starter quota\" locally (e.g., 5% of global capacity)\nand immediately ping the central store for full quota resolution in the background.\n\nControl Plane Outage:\n\nIf the Central Control Plane drops, regional clusters freeze their last-known token\nallocations and continue operating locally. The system gracefully degrades without total outage.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Final Considerations\nEdge Cases to Solve\nCold Start / Idle Keys:\n\nIf a brand-new API key starts making requests, how does a region\nknow how many tokens to give it without contacting the control plane?\n\nSolution: Pre-allocate a default low \"starter quota\" locally (e.g., 5% of global capacity)\nand immediately ping the central store for full quota resolution in the background.\n\nControl Plane Outage:\n\nIf the Central Control Plane drops, regional clusters freeze their last-known token\nallocations and continue operating locally. The system gracefully degrades without total outage.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zdhxWDpA38S5KnySvZvtv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5302.487238225664,
      "y": 3349.092441571215,
      "width": 687.1673583984375,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 851122379,
      "version": 304,
      "versionNonce": 124706355,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789577882910,
      "created": 1789574668500,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Failures on different components:\n\n1. Redis failure\nTo ensure high availability:\n1. cluster sharding: redis keys are shared across multiple nodes using consistent hashing\non hash(api_key) to distribute 100k QOPS load evenly\n2. Each master shard will have ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Failures on different components:\n\n1. Redis failure\nTo ensure high availability:\n1. cluster sharding: redis keys are shared across multiple nodes using consistent hashing\non hash(api_key) to distribute 100k QOPS load evenly\n2. Each master shard will have ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
