      "text": "Ride Hailing System",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ride Hailing System",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4CMTaUhXLNW7opGwvZZEY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 447.3671875,
      "y": 308.47265625,
      "width": 698.6553955078125,
      "height": 420,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 439679763,
      "version": 811,
      "versionNonce": 1571677459,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789657688868,
      "created": 1789655075608,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement\n\n- Riders Side\n* Request ride\n* see estimated fare\n* see driver current location (ride is active)\n\n- System\n* Try to find closest driver based on ETA, keeping a pool of drivers nearby\nsorted based on eta to pickup location\n* rides across multiple regions\n* rides :\nrequested -> matching -> driver offered -> accepted -> in progress -> completed/cancelled\n\n- Driver Side\n* accept/reject rides\n* see estimated fare\n* Become available/unavailable\n* See pickup and drop location\n* mark completed, once ride reach drop point\n* disconnecting after being matched?, rematching",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement\n\n- Riders Side\n* Request ride\n* see estimated fare\n* see driver current location (ride is active)\n\n- System\n* Try to find closest driver based on ETA, keeping a pool of drivers nearby\nsorted based on eta to pickup location\n* rides across multiple regions\n* rides :\nrequested -> matching -> driver offered -> accepted -> in progress -> completed/cancelled\n\n- Driver Side\n* accept/reject rides\n* see estimated fare\n* Become available/unavailable\n* See pickup and drop location\n* mark completed, once ride reach drop point\n* disconnecting after being matched?, rematching",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "AeBC790tS27l1YUVnRB8-",
      "type": "magicframe",
      "x": 432.4296875,
